# STM32G0 boot/connect smoke test. Brings up the Renode stm32g0
# backend end-to-end via the upstream @platforms/cpus/stm32g0.repl
# (which ships its own RCC stub at 0x40021000). Distinct from the F1
# path (local rcc_stub), the F4 path (STM32F4_RCC) and the H7 path
# (STM32H7_RCC). printers.test reaches G0 chips (e.g. SKR Mini E3 v3,
# STM32G0B1) at config-parse depth; this is the firmware-boot
# regression target. Uses the stm32g0b1 build.
DICTIONARY stm32g0b1.dict
CONFIG stm32g0_smoke.cfg
EMULATOR stm32g0_smoke.fixture.json

M114
M105
M105
M105

EXPECT_LOG_CONTAINS "Loaded MCU 'mcu'"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "Internal error"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "Klippy is shutdown"
